        {
            "block_label": "image",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_153_100_918_388.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"71%\" />\n\nGender equality (latent, multidimensional, and intersectional construct)\nStep 1: Conceptualization: Define domains and (if needed) sub-domains\nStep 2: Operationalization: Select observable variables and compute simple indicators (e.g., ratios and averages)\nStep 3: Data processing: Normalization/scaling, directionality alignment, and missing-data handling\nStep 4: Within-domain aggregation: Choose an aggregation function and (possibly) weights\nStep 5: Across-domain aggregation: Combine domain scores to obtain overall index\nGEI (score from 1–100)\n\n</div>\n",
            "block_bbox": [
