        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Within the system of domains and sub-domains, a total of 31 observable variables and simple indicators are selected; henceforth, for brevity and clarity, we refer to them as GEI ingredients since they are the main components of the composite indicator. The complete lists of the six domains, fourteen sub-domains, and thirty-one ingredients are shown in the first three columns of Figure 3. The fourth column refers to the Italian case study, which will be",
